{
  "_readme": [
    "Personal, git-ignored overrides. Copy this file to .claude/settings.local.json and fill in the env values.",
    "SUPABASE_DB_URL is the direct, password-bearing connection to the LOCAL Supabase Postgres ONLY (started via `supabase start`; `supabase status` prints it) — used by migrations/tooling and the rls_verify probe. Never point it at a shared or production database.",
    "CORPUS_INDEX_URL optionally points the corpus_search MCP server at a remote citation index; leave it empty to use the checked-in corpus index.",
    "The shared settings.json already allows Bash/WebFetch broadly (the PreToolUse guards, not permission prompts, are the enforcement layer); add personal permission overrides here only to tighten, or to clear a specific `ask` entry you hit often."
  ],
  "env": {
    "SUPABASE_DB_URL": "",
    "CORPUS_INDEX_URL": ""
  }
}
